    {"id":"econ-agriculture-card-7","subjectCode":"ECON","subtopicId":"econ-agriculture","front":"For how many crops is MSP announced, and who recommends it?","back":"23 crops; recommended by CACP (introduced 1965-66).","examPoint":"MSP — 23 crops, CACP","source":"notes","verified":true},
